        <li>#i#</li>
            <cfif NOT i MOD ceiling(numberOfEntries / numberOfColumns)>
                </ul>
                <ul style="float:left;">
            </cfif>
    </cfloop>
</ul>

Use ceiling() instead of round() to ensure that you don't have extra values at the end of the list and that the last column is shortest.

